        <![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="\assets\css\APlayer.min.css"><script src="\assets\js\APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><p>使用Linux环境下Docker搭建，本教程只做分享无任何不良引导，引发任何问题本站不负任何责任！</p><span id="more"></span><hr><p>基于Dineshkarthik的项目， 电报视频下载，电报资源下载，跨平台，支持web查看下载进度 ，支持bot下发指令下载，支持下载已经加入的私有群但是限制下载的资源。</p><p><em>本文设备使用：网新云Oect (Nas)</em></p><p><em>系统：Armbian（Ubuntu）</em></p><p><em>提示：此Bot需要<del>科学上网</del>环境，如果你没有或不知道如何给 Nas &amp; 服务器 挂载梯子，请先看这篇<a href="https://xiaooyao.github.io/2026/02/11/%E5%9C%A8%20Nas%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8%20%E4%B8%8A%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%20%E6%A2%AF%E5%AD%90%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8A%E7%BD%91%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%5B%E8%AE%A9Docker%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93%E8%80%8C%E5%8F%91%E6%84%81%5D"><u>文章</u></a>(点击跳转)</em></p><hr><h2 id="前情提要："><a href="#前情提要：" class="headerlink" title="前情提要："></a>前情提要：</h2><p>​本教程所有环境&#x2F;工具来源：</p><p>​<a href="https://xiaooyao.github.io/2026/02/11/%E5%9C%A8%20Nas%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8%20%E4%B8%8A%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%20%E6%A2%AF%E5%AD%90%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8A%E7%BD%91%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%5B%E8%AE%A9Docker%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93%E8%80%8C%E5%8F%91%E6%84%81%5D">Nas版科学上网</a></p><p>​<a href="https://github.com/tangyoha/telegram_media_downloader/">Telegram媒体下载机器人</a></p><p>​<strong>魔法有风险，使用需谨慎</strong></p><p><em>Ps：在本教程中，梯子&#x2F;魔法&#x2F;科学上网环境，统一称为<strong>链路</strong></em>;</p><p>​本教程只含Linux版指令，win请到上方工具来源中寻找</p><p>​本教程<strong>不分享</strong>任何 <strong>梯子&#x2F;魔法&#x2F;科学上网</strong>！</p><p>那么，进行以下步骤！</p><hr><h2 id="前期准备"><a href="#前期准备" class="headerlink" title="前期准备"></a>前期准备</h2><p>一台 服务器&#x2F;Nas(运行Linux类型系统，且已经基本调教完毕)</p><p>一台能连接 服务器&#x2F;Nas 的电脑</p><p>运行配置: C &gt;&#x3D;  2 ; G &gt;&#x3D; 2G</p><p>如果你手握一台崭新服务器，先调教一下，使docker适配国内网络环境</p><p>服务器&#x2F;Nas 以及电脑 要求已经安装好<u>链路</u></p><p><u>确认你的 服务器&#x2F;Nas 能够通过链路连接到纸飞机api</u></p><h2 id="一-直接安装（方式一）"><a href="#一-直接安装（方式一）" class="headerlink" title="一.直接安装（方式一）"></a>一.直接安装（方式一）</h2><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git clone https://github.com/tangyoha/telegram_media_downloader.git</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">cd telegram_media_downloader</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">make install</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="二-Docker（方式二）"><a href="#二-Docker（方式二）" class="headerlink" title="二.Docker（方式二）"></a>二.Docker（方式二）</h2><h3 id="1-请确认安装了docker和docker-compose"><a href="#1-请确认安装了docker和docker-compose" class="headerlink" title="1.请确认安装了docker和docker-compose"></a>1.请确认安装了docker和docker-compose</h3><h3 id="2-启动你已经部署好的链路并开启了局域网连接-详情看往期文章-，更换docker镜像源为官方源-详情指令看往期文章"><a href="#2-启动你已经部署好的链路并开启了局域网连接-详情看往期文章-，更换docker镜像源为官方源-详情指令看往期文章" class="headerlink" title="2.启动你已经部署好的链路并开启了局域网连接(详情看往期文章)，更换docker镜像源为官方源(详情指令看往期文章)"></a>2.启动你已经部署好的链路并开启了局域网连接(详情看往期<a href="https://xiaooyao.github.io/2026/02/11/%E5%9C%A8%20Nas%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8%20%E4%B8%8A%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%20%E6%A2%AF%E5%AD%90%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8A%E7%BD%91%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%5B%E8%AE%A9Docker%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93%E8%80%8C%E5%8F%91%E6%84%81%5D">文章</a>)，更换docker镜像源为官方源(详情指令看往期<a href="https://xiaooyao.github.io/2026/02/10/oect%E5%88%B7armbian%E5%92%8Ccasaos%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/">文章</a>)</h3><h3 id="3-按照以下指令逐步安装"><a href="#3-按照以下指令逐步安装" class="headerlink" title="3.按照以下指令逐步安装"></a>3.按照以下指令逐步安装</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">docker pull tangyoha/telegram_media_downloader:latest</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">mkdir -p ~/app &amp;&amp; mkdir -p ~/app/log/ &amp;&amp; cd ~/app</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tangyoha/telegram_media_downloader/master/docker-compose.yaml -O docker-compose.yaml</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tangyoha/telegram_media_downloader/master/config.yaml -O config.yaml</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tangyoha/telegram_media_downloader/master/data.yaml -O data.yaml</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-编辑config以及其他准备"><a href="#4-编辑config以及其他准备" class="headerlink" title="4.编辑config以及其他准备"></a>4.编辑config以及其他准备</h3><p>继续输入以下指令：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">nano config.yaml</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>将里面内容全部替换为：</p><p><em>(下方替换样式只适合Linux版Docker安装方式，其他样式可进纸飞机交流群寻求帮助，详情请看工具来源处）</em></p><p>连按 Ctrl + x + y + Enter 保存退出文件</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">api_hash: </span><br><span class="line">api_id: </span><br><span class="line">bot_token: </span><br><span class="line">web_host: 0.0.0.0</span><br><span class="line">chat:</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">- chat_id: </span><br><span class="line">  last_read_message_id:</span><br><span class="line">media_types:</span><br><span class="line">- audio</span><br><span class="line">- photo</span><br><span class="line">- video</span><br><span class="line">- document</span><br><span class="line">- voice</span><br><span class="line">- video_note</span><br><span class="line">file_formats:</span><br><span class="line">  audio:</span><br><span class="line">  - all</span><br><span class="line">  document:</span><br><span class="line">  - pdf</span><br><span class="line">  - epub</span><br><span class="line">  video:</span><br><span class="line">  - mp4</span><br><span class="line">  - mkv</span><br><span class="line">proxy:</span><br><span class="line">  scheme: socks5</span><br><span class="line">  hostname: host.docker.internal</span><br><span class="line">  port: 7890</span><br><span class="line">  language: ZH</span><br><span class="line">file_path_prefix:</span><br><span class="line">- chat_title</span><br><span class="line">- media_datetime</span><br><span class="line">language: ZH</span><br><span class="line">save_path: /app/downloads</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><em>这里倒数第7行”port: 7890”可根据你的链路端口自行修改</em></p><p>再次输入：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">nano docker-compose.yaml</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>将里面第十行的”#environment”等直到”volumes”其间的内容替换为(注意缩进)：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">environment:</span><br><span class="line">      - http_proxy=socks5h://host.docker.internal:7890</span><br><span class="line">      - https_proxy=socks5h://host.docker.internal:7890 </span><br><span class="line">extra_hosts:</span><br><span class="line">      - &quot;host.docker.internal:host-gateway&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><em>这里的两个”: 7890”可根据你的链路端口自行修改</em></p><p>连按 Ctrl + x  再按 y 和 Enter 保存文件</p><p><img src="/images/settings.png" alt="settings"></p><h4 id="4-1获取bot-token"><a href="#4-1获取bot-token" class="headerlink" title="4.1获取bot_token"></a>4.1获取bot_token</h4><p>​与BotFather聊天</p><p>​点击”打开”</p><p><img src="/images/botfather1.png" alt="botfather1"></p><p><img src="/images/botfather2.png" alt="botfather2"></p><p>​输入要创建的机器人名称,用户名</p><p>​将BotToken复制下来，并粘贴到上方内容的”bot_token”处，注意空一格再填入</p><p>​此时可搜索填入的用户名找到机器人，放其备用。</p><h4 id="4-2获取api"><a href="#4-2获取api" class="headerlink" title="4.2获取api"></a>4.2获取api</h4><p>​登录纸飞机api<a href="https://my.telegram.org/">官网</a></p><p><img src="/images/telegram.orglogin.png" alt="登录纸飞机图"></p><p>​输入国区号及手机号后，官方会在应用内发给你一串代码(code)</p><p>​输入到”<strong>Confirmation code</strong>“一栏中</p><p>​登录后点击”<strong>API development tools</strong>“即可创建机器人api</p><p>​由于小编已经完成此步骤，不再过多叙述</p><p>​将”api_id”和”api_bash”分别对应填入config.yaml，例下：</p><p><img src="/images/apitianru.png" alt="api填入"></p><p>​连按 Ctrl + x  再按 y 和 Enter 保存文件</p><h4 id="4-3bot设置"><a href="#4-3bot设置" class="headerlink" title="4.3bot设置"></a>4.3bot设置</h4><p>​bot登录方式为两种，分为bot登录和mobile user登录</p><p>​两种登录所设权限不同，以下仅展示mobile user登录（用创建机器人的手机号登录）</p><p>​打开@BotFather</p><p>​点击你的机器人进入详情页面</p><p>​下滑找到”Settings”栏中的”Bot Settings”</p><p>​<img src="/images/setting2.png" alt="setting2"></p><p>​按如下图片进行配置</p><p>​<img src="/images/setting.jpg" alt="setting"></p><h3 id="5-启动-停止及更新"><a href="#5-启动-停止及更新" class="headerlink" title="5.启动,停止及更新"></a>5.启动,停止及更新</h3><h4 id="5-1启动"><a href="#5-1启动" class="headerlink" title="5.1启动"></a>5.1启动</h4><p>开放防火墙端口”5000”和”7890”(<u>此处7890可替换为上文你所修改的链路的端口</u>)</p><p>在控制端文件目录下(~&#x2F;app)输入：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">docker-compose run --rm telegram_media_downloader</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>等待一会后，正常就会出现以下问题：</p><p><img src="/images/1.png" alt="1"></p><p>这里本教程采用moblie登录，也就是你注册机器人所用的纸飞机账号 的绑定的手机号</p><p>​输入”国家码+手机号”</p><p>​按”y”回车</p><p>​将app内收到的验证码填入</p><p>​登录成功！转到机器人聊天页面</p><p><img src="/images/ok.png" alt="ok"></p><h4 id="5-2停止"><a href="#5-2停止" class="headerlink" title="5.2停止"></a>5.2停止</h4><p>​停止机器人可使用宝塔停止Docker示例&amp;执行以下命令：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">docker-compose down</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>​退出前台 后台保活 执行：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">docker-compose up -d</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="5-3更新"><a href="#5-3更新" class="headerlink" title="5.3更新"></a>5.3更新</h4><h5 id="Docker版："><a href="#Docker版：" class="headerlink" title="Docker版："></a>Docker版：</h5><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">docker pull tangyoha/telegram_media_downloader:latest</span><br><span class="line">cd ~/app</span><br><span class="line">docker-compose down</span><br><span class="line">docker-compose up -d</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>​每行代码分别复制执行</p><h5 id="直接安装版："><a href="#直接安装版：" class="headerlink" title="直接安装版："></a>直接安装版：</h5><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">cd telegram_media_downloader</span><br><span class="line">pip3 install -r requirements.txt</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>​每行代码分别复制执行</p><h3 id="6-命令总结"><a href="#6-命令总结" class="headerlink" title="6.命令总结"></a>6.命令总结</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">#下载普通团体的所有消息 </span><br><span class="line">- /download https://t.me/fkdhlg</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">#私有群（频道）链接，就是复制一个群消息链接</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">#下载从第 0 条消息开始的所有消息 </span><br><span class="line">- /download https://t.me/12000000</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">#下载从第二条消息 </span><br><span class="line">- /download https://t.me/12000000 2</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">#T下载从第二条消息开始，结束时为 100 </span><br><span class="line">- /download https://t.me/12000000 2 100</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">#直接下载，直接给你的机器人发消息</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">#直接下载一条消息</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="好！大功告成！"><a href="#好！大功告成！" class="headerlink" title="好！大功告成！"></a>好！大功告成！</h1><hr><p>其他问题可查阅工具来源（包括本篇未提及的群晖安装教程等）</p><p><a href="https://github.com/tangyoha/telegram_media_downloader/issues">Github telegram_media Issues 问题解答</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/tangyoha/telegram_media_downloader/wiki">Github telegram_media wiki 百科</a></p><p><em>Ps:来源未提及卸载命令（悲）</em></p><h2 id="六-最后最后"><a href="#六-最后最后" class="headerlink" title="六.最后最后"></a>六.最后最后</h2><p>此行为有风险，操作请谨慎。再次申明 此教程只用于技术性需求！！！，<strong>不提供</strong>梯子,魔法,科学上网订阅。若被不可抗力因素删除，本站没有义务解释和再次发布相关内容。</p><hr><p><code>&lt;©SMEL &amp; Xiaooyao&gt;</code></p><p><code>&lt;转载引用请注明出处&gt;</code></p><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/spoiler.css" type="text/css"><script src="/js/spoiler.js" type="text/javascript" async></script>]]>
